@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 32 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Linguistic Researcher" as Researcher
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Produce Global Language Report" as UC_LanguageReport
    usecase "Query World Population" as UC_QueryWorld
    usecase "Query Language Speaker Data" as UC_QueryLanguages
    usecase "Calculate World Percentages" as UC_CalcPercentages
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UC_Error
}

' Primary Actor Interactions
Researcher --> UC_LanguageReport

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UC_LanguageReport .> UC_QueryWorld : <<include>>
UC_LanguageReport .> UC_QueryLanguages : <<include>>
UC_LanguageReport .> UC_CalcPercentages : <<include>>

' System Actor Interactions
UC_QueryWorld --> DB
UC_QueryLanguages --> DB

' Failure Extension
UC_LanguageReport <.. UC_Error : <<extend>>\n(Database Connection\nFailure)

' Notes
note right of UC_LanguageReport
  Generates population report for:
  - Chinese
  - English
  - Hindi
  - Spanish
  - Arabic
  Sorted descending with world %
end note

note bottom of UC_Error
  Triggered if MySQL database
  is unreachable or data is missing
end note

@enduml